<title>USA: Brandywine to buy nine properties.</title>
<headline>Brandywine to buy nine properties.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON SQUARE, Pa. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust said on Friday it entered into an agreement to buy a portfolio of nine properties in the suburban Philadelphia area for about $30.3 million.</p>
<p>The company said $26.5 million of that sum would be paid in preferred shares, convertible under certain circumstances, into up to 1.606 million common shares.</p>
</text>
